---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout page="changelog">
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
      <header
        class="mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <h1
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.title">更新日志</h1
        >
        <div class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">
          <span data-i18n="changelog.meta">MoliShot 版本历史</span> &middot;
          <a
            href="https://github.com/gusibi/MoliShot/releases"
            target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            data-i18n="changelog.githubReleases"
            class="text-accent hover:underline">GitHub Releases</a
          >
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- v0.7.1 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.7.1</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2026-07-18</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v071Title"
        >
          界面与交互整改：全新设置页与编辑器交互优化
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v071Item1">重构设置页面：使用 SwiftUI Form 与 NavigationSplitView 替换自定义侧边栏，完美适配系统原生外观、明暗主题与强调色</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v071Item2">优化编辑器工具栏：新增分割线分组、常用颜色色板，支持在小截图下自动收起低频控件至溢出菜单</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v071Item3">新增裁剪模式常驻确认条（✓ / ✕），提供清晰的退出指引，并简化了状态栏像素信息</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v071Item4">工具栏按钮与快捷键录制按钮补充完整的 Tooltip 操作提示，优化缩放微调及弹出框手势等体验</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.7.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.7.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2026-06-20</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v070Title"
        >
          编辑器重构：真实撤销/重做、resize、裁剪模态、复制粘贴
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item1">真实撤销/重做栈（替换旧的"删除最后标注"伪撤销），拖拽与滑块改动合并为单个撤销步</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item2">选中标注可改颜色/描边/字号/不透明度/填充色，新增字号与不透明度滑块</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item3">8-handle resize（形状/画笔/文字/数字）与线条/箭头端点 handle，文字 resize 缩放字号</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item4">分类型就近命中：线条/箭头/画笔用点到线段距离，空白处不再误选</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item5">非破坏性裁剪模态：十字光标 + 遮罩预览，Enter/Esc 控制，底图不被截断</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item6">复制/粘贴/重复标注（Cmd+C/V/D，自定义 UTI + PNG 兜底，跨窗口）</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item7">Z 序调整（Cmd+] / [ / Shift+] / [），单键工具切换 V/R/O/L/A/P/T/N/B/X/Y</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item8">可调模糊半径/像素块大小，PNG/JPEG 保存格式 + 质量滑块</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v070Item9">CoreImage 模糊/像素化渲染缓存，拖拽更流畅；标注改为值类型 struct + UUID + Codable</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.6.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.6.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2026-06-19</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v060Title"
        >
          修复 Retina 截图模糊 + 测试基建
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v060Item1">修复 Retina 屏截图模糊：使用 backingScaleFactor 计算像素比例，导出保留真实像素</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v060Item2">NSImage 扩展直接使用 CGImage 真实像素，粘贴板仅写 PNG 避免低分辨率</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v060Item3">新增 MoliShotTests 单元测试 target（xcodegen），72 个测试覆盖编辑器核心逻辑</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v060Item4">完善 .gitignore，动态外观变化处理，应用图标更新</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.5.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.5.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2026-06-18</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v050Title"
        >
          动态外观适配与应用图标（未正式发版）
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v050Item1">处理系统外观动态变化，明暗主题切换即时响应</li>
          <li class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono" data-i18n="changelog.v050Item2">更新应用图标，版本号升至 0.5.0</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.4.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.4.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2026-05-26</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v040Title"
        >
          设计系统全面升级，明暗主题适配
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item1"
          >
            引入 MoliDesign 设计系统，统一全应用色彩与组件风格
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item2"
          >
            所有窗口支持明/暗主题自动切换，自适应外观变化
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item3"
          >
            OCR 窗口重新设计：紧凑迷你面板、字符计数、展开/收起切换
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item4"
          >
            偏好设置页面视觉全面重做：新色彩体系、状态标签、图标导航
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item5"
          >
            历史记录卡片升级：更大预览图、图标按钮、自适应主题
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item6"
          >
            编辑器工具栏与贴图窗口适配新设计语言
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v040Item7"
          >
            按钮添加无障碍标签与 tooltip
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.3.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.3.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2025</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v030Title"
        >
          交叉线与放大镜改进，OCR 布局优化
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v030Item1"
          >
            改进十字线与放大镜视觉效果，提升截图选区精度
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v030Item2"
          >
            优化 OCR 结果窗口布局
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v030Item3"
          >
            改进贴图 (Pin) 流程与交互体验
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v030Item4"
          >
            添加 GitHub Actions CI 工作流
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- v0.2.0 -->
      <article
        class="py-8 border-b border-bord dark:border-[#222]"
      >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent"
            >v0.2.0</span
          >
          <span
            class="font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]">2025</span
          >
        </div>
        <h2
          class="font-mono font-semibold text-xl mb-4"
          data-i18n="changelog.v020Title">首个公开版本</h2
        >
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item1"
          >
            区域截图：十字线框选、放大镜、pt/px 尺寸、Space 移动、Shift 锁比例、Option 中心缩放
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item2"
          >
            全屏截图：当前显示器捕获
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item3"
          >
            滚动截图：Vision 帧间配准 + 手动滚动拼接
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item4"
          >
            标注编辑器：箭头、矩形、椭圆、直线、画笔、文字、编号、高亮、模糊、像素化、裁剪
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item5"
          >
            OCR 文字识别：Vision 框架自动语言检测
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item6"
          >
            贴图悬浮 (Pin)：浮动窗口置顶
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item7"
          >
            屏幕取色器：NSColorSampler + HEX 复制 + HUD
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item8"
          >
            历史记录：Application Support 持久化 + 网格浏览
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item9"
          >
            全局快捷键：CGEventTap + HotKey 降级，默认 ⇧⌘1/3/4/P/R
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item10"
          >
            偏好设置：快捷键、权限状态、历史路径
          </li>
          <li
            class="relative pl-6 text-mute dark:text-[#888] before:absolute before:left-0 before:content-['>'] before:text-accent before:font-mono"
            data-i18n="changelog.v020Item11"
          >
            导出分享：剪贴板、保存 PNG、上传 0x0.st
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div
        class="text-center py-12 font-mono text-sm text-mute-dim dark:text-[#555]"
      >
        <p>
          <span data-i18n="changelog.fullHistory"
            >查看完整版本历史请访问</span
          >
          <a
            href="https://github.com/gusibi/MoliShot/releases"
            target="_blank" rel="noopener"
            data-i18n="changelog.githubReleases"
            class="text-accent hover:underline">GitHub Releases</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- JSON-LD -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "首页", "item": "https://molishot.eztoolab.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "更新日志", "item": "https://molishot.eztoolab.com/changelog" }
      ]
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
